  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "As FERC Chairman, Laura V. Swett said she is committed to guiding the agency through a growth opportunity. She described a FERC order as a step toward fortifying national and economic security in the AI revolution while preserving just and reasonable rates, and said clarifying rules would help release a bottleneck of large load investments in the PJM footprint. She identified rapid demand growth from data centers and other large-scale consumers as reshaping the transmission landscape and said her priority is to connect and power data centers quickly and durably.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s5",
    "s6"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "As FERC Chairman, Laura V. Swett said she is committed to guiding the agency through a growth opportunity.",
